    "body": "Adds a config for the [Pyfun](https://github.com/simontreanor/Pyfun) language server. Pyfun is an F#-inspired, functional-first language that compiles to readable Python. The `pyfun` binary bundles the language server (`pyfun lsp`, stdio) and installs with `pip install pyfun-lang`; the config activates on the `pyfun` filetype with `.git` as the root marker.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
